/target
# Per-run SSH keys, binaries, tarballs, raw per-message records, remote job
# output and the generated tables stay local. The write-up (BENCHMARK.md),
# the run ids, the environment dumps and the perf census are what get committed.
results/**/ssh/
results/**/bin/
results/**/res/
results/**/early/
results/**/*.tgz
results/**/*.bin
results/**/run.log
results/**/job-*.log
results/**/binance-args.txt
results/**/replay_server
results/**/relay.*
results/**/records/
results/**/logs/
results/**/scripts/
results/**/cond-warnings.txt
results/**/tables.md
results/**/tables-local.md
